# Force LF regardless of the contributor's git config (core.autocrlf on
# Windows / WSL checks text out as CRLF, which breaks the shell scripts
# with `$'\r'` errors). Mirrors quirk's .gitattributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.quirk  text eol=lf
*.c      text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
